WEBVTT

00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:10.400
I'm shining so brightly right now!

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:12.820
Um...

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:16.700
Do you think I could interview you now?

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:21.080
Let me introduce myself. I'm the representative
of the newspaper club, Rumina Rikyu.

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:24.210
Your club battle today was a spectacular debut.

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:25.540
Aw, shucks...

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:27.130
How exactly did you win?

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:30.630
How? U-Um...

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:34.050
I guess you could say I won
because I was meant to win?

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:38.970
Like I was well prepared?
I think it's called an awakening?

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:41.230
Something like that...

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:42.480
I see.

00:00:42.690 --> 00:00:44.310
What? What's with that reaction?

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:46.980
Didn't I suddenly rise to fame
as the school hero?

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:50.440
This isn't an apology interview with
someone who made a mistake, right?

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:54.280
Who would you like to share
the joy of winning with?

00:00:54.490 --> 00:00:55.870
Of course—

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:00.000
That was a wonderful fight.

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:03.710
There is no doubt that you
are the hero of Mikagura Academy.

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:08.210
But, would you become a hero
I can keep all to myself?

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:10.710
W-With pleasure!

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:12.340
Well, that's it for the interview.

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:14.970
Oh, Seisa!

00:02:50.900 --> 00:02:52.980
Oh, this is delicious!

00:02:53.190 --> 00:02:55.990
I can't believe I can eat
such fancy food for breakfast!

00:02:56.190 --> 00:03:00.120
This is thanks to the points
I got from yesterday's match, huh?

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:04.120
"Oh, I had some leftovers
from making sandwiches!"

00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:08.370
The days where I had to fill my empty stomach
with crusts someone gave me are over, huh?

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:10.630
Your soliloquy is too sad, ryui.

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:12.920
Ichinomiya!

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:17.130
You were amazing! You were amazing!

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:24.600
I was shocked that Himi lost,
but more than that, I was so happy...

00:03:24.810 --> 00:03:26.810
As expected of my former sleeping bag friend.

00:03:27.020 --> 00:03:29.390
You can always come back to your sleeping bag!

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:30.810
No, thank you.

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:34.020
Oh, don't be shy! You're so cute!

00:03:38.490 --> 00:03:40.530
It's the drama club!

00:03:42.410 --> 00:03:45.660
Hey, Ichinomiya! You were here after all, huh?

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:46.830
After all?

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:51.330
I saw in the newspaper club's extra edition. Look!

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:52.580
Let's see...

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:57.710
"Talk of the School, New Student Eruna
Ichinomiya Lives It up Starting with Breakfast"?!

00:03:57.920 --> 00:04:01.050
What is this? It has nothing
to do with yesterday's interview!

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:03.050
Anyway, when did she take this pic?

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:09.390
I think it's nice that it
shows the real you, though.

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:13.520
Besides, you've become a contender
to win the rookie battle overnight.

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:14.560
Rookie battle?

00:04:14.770 --> 00:04:17.610
It's a tournament battle for new students, ryui.

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:23.200
It's an important competition that influences
the power structure of Mikagura Academy.

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:25.370
Wow, there was something like that?

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:29.040
Oh, I'm Usamaru, a first year like you!

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:31.120
You were totally cool yesterday!

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:36.290
You were so passionate! I won't lose to you
in the rookie battle! Oh, the passion!

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:39.420
Thanks. Um, your name's Uzamaru?

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:44.390
Not "Uzamaru"! Rabbits become
passionate when they're lonely!

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:46.390
I learned a lot, too.

00:04:46.600 --> 00:04:48.060
This kid's a first year, too.

00:04:48.270 --> 00:04:50.060
I call him Tonkyun.

00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:51.390
Tonkyun?

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:56.520
Nyamirin, can I cancel the nickname "Tonkyun"?

00:04:56.730 --> 00:04:58.360
Oh, my real name is—

00:04:58.570 --> 00:05:02.490
Growl! I'm looking forward to the rookie battle, rowr!

00:05:02.700 --> 00:05:05.910
Oh, I'm Kumano, a second year, rowr!

00:05:06.120 --> 00:05:07.780
Oh, she's cute...

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:11.870
You surprised all of us
in the drama club, Ichinomiya.

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:15.460
I mean, the only other person
who can activate their power

00:05:15.670 --> 00:05:18.670
without an item at this school is Seisa.

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:22.630
Well, I'm sure that's because of the
mutual love between Seisa and me.

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:24.760
I mean, our bodies and souls are one.

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:27.600
Oh, right! I haven't reported my win to her yet!

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:29.350
I'm going to go find her!

00:05:29.560 --> 00:05:32.810
Whoa, Eruna! Wait, ryui!

00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:35.650
I'm really very sorry, everyone.

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:41.990
Jeez, Ichinomiya is always so open—
I mean, so honest with herself.

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:45.610
I'm here again!

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:47.820
Not like she'll let us in, ryui.

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:52.000
Don't worry! I prepared a secret weapon today!

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:58.340
Ding-dong! A package for you, Miss Mikagura!

00:05:58.540 --> 00:05:59.290
Ryui!

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:01.800
It's an extra-extra-extra large "ham"!

00:06:02.010 --> 00:06:05.260
- Ham, ham, ham...
- Even if you say "ham," you mean "ham<i>ster</i>," ryui.

00:06:05.470 --> 00:06:09.430
She'll definitely be taken in
by Himi's cuteness and open the gate!

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:12.390
There's no way she'd open it for th—ryui!

00:06:15.770 --> 00:06:18.810
Jeez, you tricked me, Eruna!

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:20.150
Sorry, sorry!

00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:25.530
My lady wanted to hear your thoughts
on the battle yesterday.

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:32.490
My lady, I have brought the two eejit visitors.

00:06:35.210 --> 00:06:38.670
It's the room my goddess lives in!
This is where she—

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:43.050
Th-Th-This is...!

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:45.550
These have touched her skin!

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:53.060
They smell like Bulgarian roses...

00:06:53.260 --> 00:06:54.930
- Ow...
- Stop messing around, ryui.

00:06:55.140 --> 00:06:56.980
Oh! I found Seisa!

00:06:57.190 --> 00:06:58.810
Huh? Where? Where?

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:06.110
Seisa...!

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:15.620
My lady, please wake up.

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:16.960
My lady...

00:07:18.920 --> 00:07:21.880
Seisa, I won the battle!

00:07:22.090 --> 00:07:24.130
I protected the honor of the going-home club!

00:07:24.340 --> 00:07:26.550
Now, praise me!

00:07:26.760 --> 00:07:29.010
I'm the type who does better when praised!

00:07:29.220 --> 00:07:31.590
Seisa, come now, go ahead!

00:07:34.100 --> 00:07:35.470
You did a good job.

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:37.730
Good job, good job!

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:43.150
This could be the peak of my entire life...

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:44.020
However...

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:44.980
Huh?

00:07:45.190 --> 00:07:51.570
I think a large part of your victory
was because Himi let down her guard.

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:54.990
Himi, if you had gone
for the win from the start,

00:07:55.200 --> 00:08:00.370
it would have been hard for Eruna
to break your crystals. Am I wrong?

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:02.790
Th-That's...

00:08:03.460 --> 00:08:04.840
That's not true!

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:10.090
I am the chosen hero of Mikagura Academy!

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:14.260
I don't really understand myself,
either, but I can feel it!

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:17.810
That's why I was able
to beat Himi on my first try!

00:08:18.020 --> 00:08:21.980
I'm sure I could put up a good fight
against you, too, Seisa!

00:08:25.320 --> 00:08:28.900
You seem to have grown very confident.

00:08:29.110 --> 00:08:31.280
Then, let's do this—

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:34.620
Why don't we have a practice battle
tomorrow after school?

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:35.620
What?!

00:08:35.830 --> 00:08:39.370
If you can break even one of my crystals,

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:42.790
I will allow you to officially
join the going-home club.

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:44.790
However, if you cannot break any,

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:46.290
then I will revoke your provisional membership,

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:49.670
and you'll go back to
not being part of any club.

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:50.550
How about it?

00:08:50.760 --> 00:08:53.340
No way! No matter how good she is,
that's impossible!

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:55.050
It's way too hard, ryui!

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:56.970
All right, let's do it then!

00:08:57.180 --> 00:08:58.180
Huh?!

00:08:58.390 --> 00:09:03.060
If I break even one, I'll become
a going-home club member—

00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:06.150
and live with you in this mansion!

00:09:06.360 --> 00:09:07.820
What?!

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:10.990
She made her own addition to the promise, ryui!

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:35.010
It's that girl in the sleeping bag.
She's the one who beat the calligraphy club rep.

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:37.680
I heard she's having a practice battle
with Seisa today.

00:09:37.890 --> 00:09:41.220
This is it! This is what I wanted!

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:43.100
But you must stay calm, Eruna.

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:45.310
You need to act cool right now.

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:46.520
Wait for me.

00:09:46.730 --> 00:09:48.690
Once I finish my battle with Seisa,

00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:53.030
I'll play a patient who sexually harasses the
new nurses by giving them suggestive orders

00:09:53.240 --> 00:09:54.610
with you all in the nurse's office.

00:09:56.410 --> 00:10:00.790
You must be really confident to be able
to have such vulgar delusions, ryui.

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:03.500
What's this place?

00:10:03.710 --> 00:10:04.910
It's a training room, ryui.

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:07.630
You can watch other people's battles
and learn from them, ryui.

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:10.460
Really? Let's see—

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:19.720
Asuhi, you're amazing!

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:20.760
Eruna!

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:24.390
I knew you were good! It was like a one-hit KO!

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:27.150
Oh no, I still have a lot to work on.

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:30.020
So cute, as usual...

00:10:30.230 --> 00:10:32.030
Um, is something the matter?

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:35.860
Oh! If you're free, will you have a
practice match with me right now—?

00:10:36.070 --> 00:10:38.070
<i>I'll</i> battle that guy.

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:49.040
I mean, you haven't even seen a proper
practice match between other people, have you?

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:53.670
I think you'd learn more by
watching a match as a spectator.

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:55.260
If you put it that way...

00:10:55.470 --> 00:10:58.510
The first years from my club want to watch, too.

00:10:58.720 --> 00:11:00.140
I want to watch, too!

00:11:00.350 --> 00:11:01.640
Huh? Um...

00:11:01.850 --> 00:11:05.430
I don't think I have the
slightest chance of beating you, though...

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:08.440
All right.

00:11:08.650 --> 00:11:12.230
I will treat this as a special opportunity
to fight someone better than me and do my best.

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:22.950
Then, let's do it.

00:11:24.490 --> 00:11:25.910
Then, I'll be the ref—

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:31.960
Naw, we don't need you, Teach.
We'll just have a fun and <i>easy</i> match.

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:36.130
All right, ryui.
But don't do anything dangerous.

00:11:36.340 --> 00:11:37.630
'Kay!

00:11:40.050 --> 00:11:43.470
Wow, so many people came to watch!

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:45.930
You don't often get to see fights
between club representatives

00:11:46.140 --> 00:11:49.640
outside of official matches, ryui.

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:57.440
15, 14, 13, 12, 11, 10, 9, 8,

00:11:57.650 --> 00:12:02.660
- 7, 6, 5, 4, 3, 2, 1, 0...

00:12:02.660 --> 00:12:04.830
- Asuhi... Imizu...
- 7, 6, 5, 4, 3, 2, 1, 0...

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:06.830
Shooting Star!

00:12:07.040 --> 00:12:08.660
Coup d'Etat Faker.

00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:13.750
Shooting Star! Shooting Star!
Shooting Star! Shooting Star!

00:12:21.010 --> 00:12:23.010
Shooting...!

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:44.620
You held your own for a few seconds.
That's not bad for a first year, I guess?

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:47.540
Asuhi!

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:50.080
You were amazing, Akama!

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:54.380
Th... Th-Thank you very much!

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:57.960
I deeply apologize for not
being a better opponent!

00:12:58.170 --> 00:12:58.800
It's fine.

00:12:59.010 --> 00:13:00.720
Good work!

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:02.380
I learned a lot.

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:04.760
It was super helpful!

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:06.350
Akama...?

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:07.430
Hm?

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:08.180
Um...

00:13:08.390 --> 00:13:11.560
Eruna! It's almost time for you to be
on standby for your practice match, ryui!

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:14.520
What? N-No way, already?!

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:15.810
You can do it!

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:17.770
We'll be there later!

00:13:22.070 --> 00:13:24.320
So this is where we're battling today, huh?

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:27.490
Unlike last time, there's nowhere
for you to hide, ryui.

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:29.830
No, but it looks like there's
plenty of space to run!

00:13:30.040 --> 00:13:30.580
Here you go.

00:13:30.790 --> 00:13:31.500
H-Huh?

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:35.040
Here you go, an extra edition!

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:39.840
Eruna! It's a wonderful day for Eruna!

00:13:40.050 --> 00:13:43.970
Why don't we call today "Eruna Day"
and make it a holiday for the two of us?

00:13:44.180 --> 00:13:47.090
I want it to be a day where I go
on a date with you every year.

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:49.180
What do you think?

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:52.890
Please, don't show your love in extreme ways!

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:55.390
Here you go, an extra edition.

00:13:57.230 --> 00:13:59.230
You're using this picture <i>now</i>?

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:07.200
Eruna, it's great! I love the adult Eruna, too—

00:14:07.410 --> 00:14:09.700
- Jeez.
- Ah, my eyes! My eyes...!

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:11.040
- Calm down.
- Ah, my eyes! My eyes...!

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:15.290
A crane.

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:17.290
What about it...?

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:20.500
It's about time to go. Flap, flap, flap...

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:24.470
One minute until the match.

00:14:24.670 --> 00:14:27.890
58, 57, 56,

00:14:28.090 --> 00:14:30.890
- She's here, ryui.
- 55, 54, 53,

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:35.350
52, 51, 50, 49...

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:44.320
Good morning. Are you ready?

00:14:44.530 --> 00:14:48.530
I'm always ready to officially
join the going-home club!

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:50.120
- That's not what I meant.
- Huh?

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:54.540
Are you ready to lose?
That's what I was asking.

00:14:57.120 --> 00:15:00.460
Unfortunately, I don't prepare
for negative things.

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:02.670
I'll surprise you!

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:10.140
...6, 5, 4, 3, 2, 1.

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:11.640
Begin the match.

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:24.530
Now, come and get me!

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:27.740
What...?!

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:33.700
No way! Is she sleeping?
She's definitely sleeping, isn't she?

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:35.870
She's even got a snot bubble!

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:37.910
If that's how you're gonna be—!

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:44.000
An opening! You're mine!

00:15:49.930 --> 00:15:52.430
Ow... Huh?

00:16:01.850 --> 00:16:03.610
My crystal...

00:16:08.490 --> 00:16:11.780
Take this! Tension max!

00:16:11.990 --> 00:16:14.910
Go...!

00:16:15.120 --> 00:16:17.580
Huh? Why?

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:19.460
That's the end.

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:24.420
Killing Art.

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:47.650
Nice try. Too bad.

00:16:55.370 --> 00:16:57.490
I'm back to not being part of any club, huh?

00:16:57.700 --> 00:16:58.580
Eruna!

00:16:58.790 --> 00:16:59.750
Huh?

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:01.620
Cheer up, ryui!

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:06.040
Ugh, stop it! I'm gonna catch your ugliness.

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:12.010
Too bad about the results, but it's
not like you to get depressed over that...

00:17:12.220 --> 00:17:13.220
Hmph!

00:17:17.510 --> 00:17:18.680
Milk?

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:24.400
Hey, are you hiding here crying?

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:26.650
Kuzuryu!

00:17:26.860 --> 00:17:29.690
Well, that would've happened to any new student.

00:17:29.900 --> 00:17:35.820
Is this... for me?
Are you trying to cheer me up...?

00:17:36.030 --> 00:17:39.990
Kuzuryu... Um...!

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:43.870
I can't drink milk, so may I please
exchange it for a different drink?

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:44.710
What?!

00:17:44.920 --> 00:17:50.420
By the way, I'm someone who
mainly likes expensive drinks! Tee-hee!

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:53.720
- If possible, I'd like something that costs at least 300 yen! Just kidding!
- You little...

00:17:58.050 --> 00:18:04.390
You know what?! Milk has lots of nutrients!
It's good for you, damn it!

00:18:05.520 --> 00:18:06.850
He doesn't litter?

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:11.730
His words are rough,
but he really only says good things, ryui.

00:18:11.940 --> 00:18:16.700
Listen. Your ability is still incomplete.

00:18:16.910 --> 00:18:18.990
It's just as Kuzuryu says, ryui.

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:23.120
Because of your inexperience,
your power didn't activate properly, ryui.

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:27.790
So does that mean that the more
experience I have, the stronger I'll be?

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:32.710
That once this rare power is perfected,
I'll be able to rule over the whole country?

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:33.840
Yay!

00:18:34.050 --> 00:18:36.550
Don't get carried away!

00:18:36.760 --> 00:18:40.550
All right! In order to gain experience,
I'll need to hurry up and find a club and—

00:18:40.760 --> 00:18:43.970
Oh, but I went to visit
a bunch of different clubs,

00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:47.810
and there wasn't really one
that seemed to fit me...

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:51.190
Ah, what am I supposed to do, then?!

00:18:51.400 --> 00:18:55.820
- Oh, what should I do...?!
- In that case, you should make your own new club, ryui.

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:56.820
Huh?

00:18:57.030 --> 00:19:01.330
As long as it's a cultural club
with at least three members,

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:06.160
it'll probably be recognized
no matter what kind of club it is, ryui.

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:09.380
A new club...? My club...

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:11.920
All right! I'll do it!

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:15.380
I'll make a new club! It's decided!

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:18.760
It'll be hard to find members this time of year.

00:19:18.970 --> 00:19:23.310
And you also just lost a practice match, ryui.

00:19:23.510 --> 00:19:25.890
Hmm, there's also the point system,

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:29.600
so no one would want to join a club
started by someone weak, huh?

00:19:29.810 --> 00:19:33.440
If you want people to consider your club,
the rookie battle will be a good place to start.

00:19:33.650 --> 00:19:34.690
Rookie battle?

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:38.950
Ryui. If you get good results there,
you'll get more attention,

00:19:39.160 --> 00:19:41.320
and you should get some club members, too.

00:19:41.530 --> 00:19:46.120
I see! Then I can't settle for something
halfhearted like "good results"!

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:48.370
I will not aim for less than first place!

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:54.040
Thanks, Bimii! You too, endearing paint-covered
Yankee, or Enoyan for short!

00:19:54.250 --> 00:19:55.710
Ah, where are you going, ryui?!

00:19:55.920 --> 00:19:58.800
Hey, don't call me something weird!

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:49.350
Seisa! I've decided!

00:20:49.560 --> 00:20:52.730
I'm going to make a new club!

00:20:52.940 --> 00:20:55.940
I may have lost pitifully today,

00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:59.440
but when I become the representative
of my ideal club one day,

00:20:59.650 --> 00:21:03.700
I want to fight you one more time, Seisa!

00:21:03.910 --> 00:21:06.700
I won't lose next time!

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:12.460
In order to do that, I'm going to win
the rookie battle and gather club members!

00:21:12.670 --> 00:21:14.710
So please watch me!

00:21:14.920 --> 00:21:16.500
In fact, I'll make sure you watch.

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:21.260
I'll show you!
I'll show myself like this, and that...!

00:21:23.300 --> 00:21:24.890
And so...

00:21:25.090 --> 00:21:26.850
Ups-a-daisy.

00:21:43.780 --> 00:21:45.410
My room's complete!

00:21:53.120 --> 00:21:55.000
Seisa...?

00:21:56.250 --> 00:22:00.250
There's no helping it.
I'll let you into the mansion.

00:22:00.460 --> 00:22:03.170
However, you're sleeping
in the hallway in your sleeping bag.

00:22:04.840 --> 00:22:07.010
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:23:41.060 --> 00:23:43.570
Seisa's Killing Art was amazing!

00:23:43.770 --> 00:23:44.440
But it was so quick,

00:23:44.650 --> 00:23:46.900
I couldn't tell at all what kind
of technique it was!

00:23:47.110 --> 00:23:50.990
Then let's check using the video
I shot with my high-speed camera!

00:23:51.200 --> 00:23:52.910
You have one of those?! Show me! Show me!

00:23:53.120 --> 00:23:54.950
Here we go, Eruna! Click!

00:23:55.160 --> 00:23:58.580
Oh, look! It's Seisa in super-slow motion!

00:23:58.790 --> 00:24:02.460
No, it's Shigure taking off his clothes!

00:24:02.670 --> 00:24:08.880
Whoops! This was the high-speed
footage I shot of me changing!

00:24:09.090 --> 00:24:09.720
Never mind that.

00:24:09.930 --> 00:24:13.390
Ichinomiya, is this a good way
to do next episode previews?

00:24:13.600 --> 00:24:15.430
Shouldn't you take them more seriously?

00:24:15.640 --> 00:24:17.850
Akama, you're too low-key!

00:24:18.060 --> 00:24:19.890
We can't get them to watch
the next episode that way!

00:24:20.100 --> 00:24:24.230
I'm normal. Aren't <i>you</i>
the one who's too hyped up?

00:24:24.440 --> 00:24:28.030
It's a preview, so this is fine!
Come on, Akama! Get more into it!

00:24:28.240 --> 00:24:33.320
I'll get into it, Eruna!
I'll get so into it, I lose all control!

00:24:33.530 --> 00:24:35.490
Next time, "Apathetic Coup d'Etat."

00:24:35.700 --> 00:24:39.410
Then maybe I'll try
getting into it a little more, too.
